/Title (Battery Degradation This is the most critical financial constraint for your hackathon pitch: every charge and discharge cycle degrades a battery. Daily V2G use adds approximately 1.8% extra capacity loss per year to the battery. A credible product must mathematically prove that the market revenue you generate safely exceeds this physical degradation cost; a service that earns less than it costs in battery wear is not viable)
